  "body": "## What\n\nThe v1 first-iteration design document for issue #6300 — Agents in worlds (MCP bridge) — at `doc/2026-11-09_design_id6300_agents_in_worlds_v1.md`, plus the spike plan (§10 of the doc; breakdown issues filed separately and linked from issue #6300).\n\n## Entry condition\n\nVerified and recorded on issue #6300 (comment 6730482300): the core topic #6280 carries recorded first-pass research findings (task 13834, comment 6729662452 on issue #6280). The design dispositions every findings constraint accept/reject (§2 — all accepted) and resolves the findings' four open uncertainties (§9).\n\n## Coverage (issue #6300 acceptance)\n\n- One agent joining a world as an MCP-bridge client, reading screens (agent profile: region subscriptions + semantic diffs, §4.2), posting chat, and one bounded program interaction (§4.6)\n- Capability ceiling enforced at the host-side policy point (§6.1), session quota with visible parking (§6.2), full audit log incl. refusals + owner summaries (§7)\n- Agent identity (own Ed25519 key), roles, UCAN-style short-lived attenuated delegation, OAuth 2.1 only at the hosted edge (§5)\n- Consistent with the #1240 Phase 14 principles throughout (§1)\n\n## Notes\n\nDocs-only change; no code touched. Filed by queue task 12936 (lane code-t).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796782007&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7911&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7911&signature=3ee01c1296fb6f0e006927e068b431214c2d2accf98781880a73c14763dfc6cd\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7911?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
